1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,679
Conditional probability.

2
00:00:01,679 --> 00:00:04,023
Suppose you are told that B has happened.

3
00:00:04,023 --> 00:00:10,221
Everything outside B is now impossible: B becomes the whole sample space.

4
00:00:10,221 --> 00:00:14,986
The chance of A is now the part of A inside B, as a fraction of B.

